Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:53:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Alert sensors: EGT 3-8, hottest EGT and fuel pressure above
 MAP (pro-style)

New gppwm_channel_e values Egt3..Egt8, FuelPressureDiff (fuel pressure minus MAP,
from the sensor mode, whatever the injector compensation) and EgtMax (hottest working
EGT). They can be used by alerts, GPPWM and every other gppwm_channel_e axis.
TS lists updated, ve/afr blend axis label offset moved from 36 to 44.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkhsyMr5ndz2MBCxuDZhPC
